      "platform": "x",
      "text": "How do you control countries\u2026\nwhen they can just say \u201cno\u201d?\nThat\u2019s the part nobody talks about.\n\nCatch the full episode on YouTube and join the conversation.\n\n#Politics #UN #Geopolitics #WhatNow\n\nVideo",
